@startuml
' Use Case Diagram: Admin
skinparam actorStyle awesome
actor Admin
'
' Vertical Use Case Diagram: Admin
skinparam actorStyle awesome
actor Admin

Admin --> (Manage Vendors)
Admin --> (Approve Vendor Registration)
Admin --> (View Reports)
Admin --> (Manage Contracts)
Admin --> (Audit Logs)
Admin --> (Reset Vendor Password)
Admin --> (Manage User Roles)

' Sub-use case (vertikal)
(Manage Vendors) --> (Add Vendor)
(Manage Vendors) --> (Edit Vendor)
(Manage Vendors) --> (Delete Vendor)
(Manage Vendors) --> (View Vendor Details)

(Manage Contracts) --> (Create Contract)
(Manage Contracts) --> (Edit Contract)
(Manage Contracts) --> (Delete Contract)
(Manage Contracts) --> (View Contract History)

(Manage User Roles) --> (Assign Role)
(Manage User Roles) --> (Remove Role)
(Manage User Roles) --> (View User List)

' Relasi include/extend
(Approve Vendor Registration) ..> (Audit Logs) : <<include>>
(Reset Vendor Password) ..> (Audit Logs) : <<include>>
(Delete Vendor) ..> (Audit Logs) : <<include>>
(Delete Contract) ..> (Audit Logs) : <<include>>

' Notes (vertikal)
note right of (Approve Vendor Registration)
  Admin dapat memverifikasi dan menyetujui pendaftaran vendor.
end note

note right of (Manage Vendors)
  Admin dapat menambah, mengedit, menghapus, dan melihat detail vendor.
end note

note right of (Manage Contracts)
  Admin dapat membuat, mengedit, menghapus, dan melihat riwayat kontrak.
end note

note right of (Audit Logs)
  Semua aktivitas penting dicatat untuk keperluan audit.
end note
@enduml
